    "### Generate longer sequences\n",
    "\n",
    "- Generate one word in the sequence at a time, in order\n",
    "- The word **does not** depend on the previous words\n",
    "- V = {“cat”, “dog”, “is”, “to”, ...}\n",
    "- Result: to, be, or, not, to, be …"
